    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given the vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be such that for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then, the set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> is</p><p>By its given condition <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>:</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>are linearly independent vectors or they are non-coplanar</p><p>We know that when vectors are non-coplanar then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
